{
  "id": 5007178137732,
  "title": "Prana Pocket Spring Latex Mattress",
  "handle": "prana",
  "description": "<style type=\"text/css\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><!--\ntd {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}\n--></style>\n<span data-sheets-value='{\"1\":2,\"2\":\"Treat yourself to a sleep experience derived from the goodness of nature. Prana is a unique 3-zoned pocket spring mattress with a natural pin core latex layer. It is naturally ventilated and has high elasticity that when combined with the zonal support and bounce offered by the pocket spring layer offers the most enriching sleep experience. The pocket spring layer also prevents movement from travelling across the mattress. Prana is enveloped in a luxe fabric infused with organic cotton for a soft, cool and truly natural sleep experience.\"}' data-sheets-userformat='{\"2\":2114,\"4\":{\"1\":2,\"2\":14275305},\"9\":1,\"14\":{\"1\":2,\"2\":0}}' data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Treat yourself to a sleep experience derived from the goodness of nature. Prana is a unique 3-zoned pocket spring mattress with a natural pin core latex layer. It is naturally ventilated and has high elasticity that when combined with the zonal support and bounce offered by the pocket spring layer offers the most enriching sleep experience. The pocket spring layer also prevents movement from travelling across the mattress. Prana is enveloped in a luxe fabric infused with organic cotton for a soft, cool and truly natural sleep experience.</span>",
